  "about": "A made-up reel page: a pipeline at its Steps level with eight modules in areas, and the steps of five other pipelines that its records link to, each drawn in an area headed by its pipeline. Its shape was read on 16 November 2026 from the drawing input of a pipeline page in an office copy that holds made-up data, by a script kept outside the repository. Kept: each record's kind, role and state; the order of the pipeline's own steps; which other pipeline lists each other step, and in what order; each link's type, ends, gate and inferred flag; each area and place. Every title, area name and partial gate's reach is made up and about as long as the words it replaced; a title shorter than its bare made-up form keeps that form. Records are named by keys made for this file and no record id is kept. Each title's length on the copy is beside it as \"length\".",
